  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land Infosystem Archangel</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Land Infosystem Archangel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att utveckla systemen f&#xf6;r registrering, bearbetning och f&#xf6;rmedling av fastighetsinformation i Arkkangelsk Oblast. Projektet genomf&#xf6;rs av Roszemkadaster, Landkommitt&#xe9;n i Arkhangelsk Oblast och det ryska justitieministeriet. Svensk part &#xe4;r Swedesurvey AB.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roszemkadastre, the Administration of Archangelsk Oblast and the Russian Ministry of Justice will, together with Swedesurvey AB, work towards develop a concept of a regional Land Information System. Information exchange will be improved and the land registration process will be developed, with increased focus on the clients.</narrative>
  </description>
